---
title: "Rollback sequence"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Human
    participant A as Agent
    participant G as Git main branch
    participant F as Flux
    A->>H: Change and rollback plan
    H->>A: Yes
    A->>G: Push the change
    F->>G: Reconcile new revision
    F-->>A: Ready at new revision
    A->>H: Proof through the real path
    Note over H,F: Rollback is git revert, then Flux reconciles again
